course: dictionary
lesson: 2415
title: Cyan: a colour and a printer ink
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Cyan is a colour word, and the sentences around it show you what it means. «Printed pictures in books and magazines are made of tiny dots of four inks, cyan, magenta, yellow and black.» The list tells you cyan is one of the inks, with magenta and yellow as its partners.
explain: Cyan is a bright greenish-blue, like a clear tropical sea. The magnifying glass sentence helps too: «cyan (a bright sky blue)». Cyan sits between blue and green, so picture the sea just before it gets deep.
explain: Colour words often come in groups. When you meet an unknown colour, look for the other colours next to it, and for pictures or things that have that colour, such as the sea. Then try your meaning in the sentence: does «cyan ink» still make sense if you think of a bright blue-green ink? If yes, you have got it.
fact: Cyan is a bright greenish-blue colour, like a clear tropical sea.
fact: Printers use four inks: cyan, magenta, yellow and black (CMYK).
fact: Cyan is a noun, as in «the cyan», and an adjective, as in «cyan ink».
fact: In light, green light and blue light mix to make cyan.
fact: Related colours are turquoise, aqua and teal.
exercise: What is cyan? | A bright red, like a fire engine | A pale yellow, like sunshine | *A bright greenish-blue, one of the four printer inks | A dark brown, like wet soil
exercise: Which two colours of light mix to make cyan? | Red and yellow | Pink and purple | *Green and blue | Black and white
exercise: Find and copy one colour word from «Printers use cyan, magenta and yellow instead, which mix cleaner colours.» | printers | mix | *cyan | instead
test: Which colour is related to cyan? | *Turquoise | Crimson | Scarlet | Violet
test: «Magenta» is a pinky purple. Which of the four inks is magenta? | Cyan | *Magenta | Black | Yellow
exam: What are the four printer inks in CMYK? | *Cyan, magenta, yellow and black | Cyan, red, green and black | Blue, pink, gold and grey | Red, green, blue and white
